    },
    {
      "id": "clm:30b4f35de4f079a6e7a96892265e85f7ce44ddb5e5442115727f03d0cba790c0",
      "text": "Non-Atlas from.connectionName connections fail parsing. Empty as or metadata-name collisions cause StreamProcessorInvalidOptions at startup. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-27)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-vectorsearch/",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:df3b19a47008d5ecb5799b07909e1f6b57e6051c1edca4382786d137cf283910"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:853d25b2131c31bab6d77fbe96254f79d9d0266aaeb522f72f8f279d219851dd",
      "text": "QuerySentinel documents ASP write-rate aggregation separately from SimilarIncidentAgent vector retrieval. Its reported vector-dimension mismatch is an application report, not evidence of native ASP-stage failure semantics. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-27)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/pulkit6732/QuerySentinel",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:83a9b37a4369c30c1835f3d6c7dce1f4470fb8a609a7327ca004125b3d9cb298",
        "ev:c4c730c0ec53a3ff9d4d503bcc83b9f3f89783b3c092c54fd475f1a3e42858bb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:ba47a2db9f01e7e0366afb96d98f9c66d9c509856865f4254d748183f68f839c",
      "text": "The media architecture enriches clicks with article metadata, summarizes sessions, and serves semantic recommendations afterward; this differs from querying an index for each incoming event. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/architecture/current/solutions-library/stream-media-personalization.md",
      "also": [],
