    {
      "id": "clm:7105e9fb7cee691825ce3931cccb1712e8b0c1b3d3e8c399b81eb12e2a24f980",
      "text": "Wrong runtime queryVector/query.text types send only that event to the configured DLQ, or drop it; later events continue. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-27)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-vectorsearch/",
