      "text": "let binds event values for the forwarded result pipeline; Native Reranking must be enabled for $rerank. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-27)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-vectorsearch/",
